NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

This software downloads and runs pre-trained model weights from Hugging Face
at runtime. Those weights carry their own licenses that are NOT covered by the
MIT license above:

  - MLX Whisper ports (mlx-community/whisper-large-v3-turbo, etc.):
    derived from OpenAI Whisper (MIT).
  - openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo: MIT.
  - mlx-community/diar_sortformer_4spk-v1-fp16: derived from NVIDIA NeMo
    Sortformer. The NVIDIA weights are released under CC-BY-NC-4.0
    (non-commercial). Verify the current license on the model card before any
    commercial use; for commercial deployments swap to an MIT-licensed
    diarization backend (e.g. mlx-community/pyannote-segmentation-3.0-mlx +
    WeSpeaker embeddings).

You are responsible for complying with the model weight licenses in your
specific use case.
